  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A spike in offensive strikes increases realized geopolitical risk for investors with regional exposure, prompting institutional risk-off reallocations and temporary withdrawals from higher‑beta sectors including technology and venture allocations.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">mideast_houthi_campaign</data>
  <data key="d40">global_financial_ai</data>
</edge>
