  <data key="d29">1</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Degraded commercial aviation services (fewer flights, route closures) constrain executive travel and site visits, delaying deal-making and slowing inbound/outbound auto-sector investment projects between China and the EU.</data>
