  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Disruptions to commercial and cargo aviation routes caused by Houthi strikes and airspace closures constrain airlift capacity and schedules used to move munitions and equipment into Europe, directly reducing the flow rate of timely arms transfers to the Russia–West theatre.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
