<edge source="mideast_houthi_campaign::energy_attack_rate" target="china_eu_auto_rivalry::vehicle_trade_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Increased attacks on tankers and maritime energy infrastructure drive up shipping insurance and force longer reroutes (e.g., around the Cape of Good Hope), raising per-unit logistics costs and transit times that directly reduce China-to-EU vehicle shipments.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">mideast_houthi_campaign</data>
  <data key="d40">china_eu_auto_rivalry</data>
</edge>
<edge source="mideast_houthi_campaign::energy_attack_rate" target="global_energy_diesel::refinery_utilization" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Increased hostile hits on refineries, terminals, pipelines and related logistics force temporary shutdowns, safe-mode operations and extended repairs, directly reducing active crude-processing throughput and utilization rates.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">mideast_houthi_campaign</data>
  <data key="d40">global_energy_diesel</data>
</edge>
<edge source="mideast_houthi_campaign::energy_attack_rate" target="global_energy_diesel::diesel_inventory_level" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Attacks that damage storage tanks, fuel terminals or distribution links and that curtail refining output lower on-hand finished-diesel stocks and prompt drawdowns from other inventories to meet demand.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">mideast_houthi_campaign</data>
  <data key="d40">global_energy_diesel</data>
</edge>
<edge source="mideast_houthi_campaign::energy_attack_rate" target="global_financial_ai::ai_investment_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Concentrated attacks on energy and nearby maritime/logistical nodes raise shipping delays and war-risk insurance costs that directly delay and raise capex for GPU/datacenter hardware deliveries, causing near-term AI project funding and commitments to be pulled or postponed.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">mideast_houthi_campaign</data>
  <data key="d40">global_financial_ai</data>
</edge>
<edge source="mideast_houthi_campaign::energy_attack_rate" target="russia_west_conflict::energy_availability" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Repeated Houthi strikes on tankers, pipelines and export terminals in key chokepoints raise insurance and rerouting costs and temporarily remove shipment capacity, directly reducing fuel and LNG deliveries available to Europe and NATO forces.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">mideast_houthi_campaign</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_west_conflict</data>
</edge>
