  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained reductions in civilian and industrial power and fuel supplies force temporary factory shutdowns, production deratings and delayed capacity ramp-ups at energy‑intensive EU auto plants, lowering effective local manufacturing capacity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_west_conflict</data>
  <data key="d40">china_eu_auto_rivalry</data>
</edge>
