  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Stronger, more cohesive Western coordination around the Russia conflict produces synchronized export controls and coordinated investment/FDI screening policies that raise the intensity and scope of restrictions applied to Chinese auto technology and firms.</data>
