  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Stronger cohesion among Western allies drives coordinated trade controls, incentives and de‑risking measures that redirect international capital toward allied tech sectors and platforms perceived as secure, increasing net flows into those technology assets.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_west_conflict</data>
  <data key="d40">global_financial_ai</data>
</edge>
