  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Large-scale arms transfers increase competition for dual‑use components (e.g., advanced semiconductors and electronics), prompting automakers and suppliers to accelerate supplier diversification and vertical integration to secure inputs, thereby increasing localization and integration of vehicle supply chains.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
