  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Increased deliveries of missiles, mines, drones and coastal-attack systems to combatants raise their capacity and willingness to strike or interdict merchant shipping in key sea lanes.</data>
