  <data key="d37">Increases in arms_transfer_volume tied to the Russia–West contest (diversion of stocks, accelerated exports, or third‑party brokers) raise the flow of missiles, UAVs and munitions into regional networks that Houthi forces can access, enabling a higher tempo of offensive strikes.</data>
