  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A rapid increase in local vehicle/EV manufacturing capacity (substituting for imported internal-combustion vehicles) reduces domestic diesel road-fuel demand, forcing refiners to cut runs and lowering global refinery utilization as exporters/allocations adjust.</data>
