  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Rapid expansion of domestic vehicle and EV manufacturing capacity financed through corporate loans, state backing and project financing increases indebtedness across banks and industrial corporates, raising average leverage ratios in financial and non‑financial sectors relevant to technology funding.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
