  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Rapid declines in diesel stocks produce fuel shortages and price spikes that immediately hit commuters, farmers and logistics firms, provoking protests and eroding domestic backing for governments' sustained conflict-related policies.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_diesel</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_west_conflict</data>
