  <data key="d37">A surge in AI investment tied to vehicle autonomy, connectivity, or data platforms—particularly when associated with Chinese firms—triggers regulatory and trade measures in the EU (data, security, certification) that tighten restrictions on cross‑border vehicle operations and market access.</data>
