  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Increased directed investment in AI accelerates commercial and open‑source development of guidance, autonomy, and targeting software that can be adapted or repurposed by non‑state actors (through leaks, contractors, or gray‑market vendors), improving reliability and sortie rates of drones/loitering munitions and raising the tempo of offensive strikes.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
