  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A looser monetary stance (lower policy rates/expanded balance sheets) lowers financing costs for governments and private purchasers, enabling quicker procurement of fuel, spare parts and grid repairs into the conflict zone and thus improving short‑term energy availability for civilian and military uses.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_ai</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_west_conflict</data>
</edge>
