  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising capital flows into technology increase available financing for EV and component startups and for OEM capital expenditures, accelerating the build‑out of localized vehicle and powertrain manufacturing capacity in China or the EU.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_ai</data>
  <data key="d40">china_eu_auto_rivalry</data>
