  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising capital flows into technology and robotics scale up manufacturing capacity and lower unit costs for small UAVs, sensors and commerical propulsion components, increasing their availability on legitimate and gray markets and thereby enabling more frequent attacks on energy infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_ai</data>
  <data key="d40">mideast_houthi_campaign</data>
